#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/email-notifications.rst:2
msgid "How to setup email notifications"
msgstr "如何设置邮件通知"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/email-notifications.rst:4
msgid ""
"In this brief guide, you can learn how to set up a simple build notification"
" via email."
msgstr "在本简短指南中，你将学习如何通过邮件设置简单的构建通知。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/email-notifications.rst:7
msgid ""
"Read the Docs allows you to configure emails that will be notified on "
"failing builds. This makes sure that you are aware of failures happening in "
"an otherwise automated process."
msgstr "Read the Docs 允许你配置在构建失败时接收通知的邮箱。这确保你能知晓原本自动化流程中发生的失败。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/email-notifications.rst:12
msgid ":doc:`/guides/build/webhooks`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/build/webhooks`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/email-notifications.rst:13
msgid ""
"How to use webhooks to be notified about builds on popular platforms like "
"Slack and Discord."
msgstr "如何使用 Webhook 在 Slack、Discord 等流行平台上接收构建通知。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/email-notifications.rst:15
msgid ":doc:`/pull-requests`"
msgstr ":doc:`/pull-requests`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/email-notifications.rst:16
msgid ""
"Configure automated feedback and documentation site previews for your pull "
"requests."
msgstr "为你的 Pull Request 配置自动反馈和文档站点预览。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/email-notifications.rst:20
msgid "Email notifications"
msgstr "邮件通知"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/email-notifications.rst:22
msgid ""
"Follow these steps to add an email address to be notified about build "
"failures:"
msgstr "按以下步骤添加接收构建失败通知的邮箱地址："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/email-notifications.rst:24
msgid "Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Email notifications`."
msgstr "前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Email notifications` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/email-notifications.rst:25
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Add notification`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Add notification` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/email-notifications.rst:26
msgid "Fill in the :guilabel:`Email` field."
msgstr "填写 :guilabel:`Email` 字段。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/email-notifications.rst:27
msgid ""
"Click on :guilabel:`Save` and the email will be displayed in the list of "
"notifications."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Save` ，该邮箱将显示在通知列表中。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/email-notifications.rst:29
msgid "The newly added email address will be notified once a build fails."
msgstr "新添加的邮箱地址将在构建失败时收到通知。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/email-notifications.rst:34
msgid ""
"We don't send email notifications on :doc:`builds from pull requests </pull-"
"requests>`."
msgstr "我们不会在 :doc:`Pull Request 构建 </pull-requests>` 上发送邮件通知。"

